        "_uid": "6236c816-6c40-6b3d-0f73-0ab46c2ff7e2",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As lockdown continued Tehmina started receiving requests for more support. This led to the creation of a new meditation - specially addressing the frightening effects of the pandemic; the \"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Mindful Conversation",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3R51ZrX0eMY&t=142s",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "\" series which launched in July and is especially aimed at people feeling affected by the post-covid life. Tehmina adds; \"Most of the people registering wrote about having trouble in their new post-covid life. Some are having a problem with routine, some have a problem with managing children; and so on. This is a free service, just like all the meditations we have posted online. We have since gotten a very good response.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
