    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In these complicated times, more and more people are looking online to help them find a sense of calm and wellbeing. AKU-ISMC alumni, Tehmina Mansoor and Zohaib Zuby have responded to this by setting up a platform sharing guided meditations in Urdu and English.  Be-khudi  combines wisdom from their native South Asia with the discipline of Mindfulness and is the first platform to offer meditations in both languages. Tehmina explains how Be-khudi is developing during the pandemic; \"We launched in January of this year right before lockdown and posted our free Urdu and English Meditations as an album.\"",
